         <a id="ntr2-L_2022215EN.01002701-E0002" href="#ntc2-L_2022215EN.01002701-E0002">(<span class="oj-super">2</span>)</a>  Commission Implementing Regulation (EU) 2017/2382 of 14 December 2017 laying down implementing technical standards with regard to standard forms, templates and procedures for the transmission of information in accordance with Directive 2014/65/EU of the European Parliament and of the Council (<a href="http://publications.europa.eu/resource/oj/JOL_2017_340_R_TOC">OJ L 340, 20.12.2017, p. 6</a>).</p>
